fred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-harmonic-form.lean#L24-L32","doc":"**q-Harmonic form (Particle)**: a section `α` in the kernel of the\nq-Laplacian `Δ_q = d_q δ_q + δ_q d_q`, i.e. `Δ_q α = 0`.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:q-harmonic-form}` ","signatureChunk":0}]}